<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AI 实时语音模拟面试 · Interview Room</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked@12.0.2/marked.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#f4f5fb; --panel:#ffffff; --line:#e7e8f2; --line2:#d9dbea;
    --text:#1c1e2a; --dim:#7a7f95; --acc:#6d5cff; --acc2:#8b7cff; --accSoft:#efedff;
    --ok:#22b573; --okSoft:#e6f7ef; --warn:#e6a23c; --err:#e5484d; --errSoft:#fdebec;
    --radius:16px; --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(28,30,42,.05),0 8px 28px rgba(28,30,42,.07);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;font-size:14px}
  .view{display:none;min-height:100vh}
  .view.active{display:block}
  button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:none;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}
  button.primary{background:var(--acc);color:#fff;padding:12px 26px;font-size:15px;transition:.15s}
  button.primary:hover{background:#5b48e8}
  button.primary:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
  button.ghost{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--text);padding:9px 16px;font-size:13px}
  button.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc)}
  button.danger{background:var(--err);color:#fff;padding:9px 18px;font-size:13px}
  input[type=text],textarea{width:100%;background:#fbfbfe;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:14px;color:var(--text);outline:none;font-family:inherit;transition:.15s}
  input:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--acc);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accSoft)}
  .hidden{display:none!important}

  /* ---------- Setup ---------- */
  #view-setup{display:none}
  #view-setup.active{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding:48px 16px}
  .setup-wrap{width:100%;max-width:720px}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:26px}
  .brand .logo{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),#9a8bff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px}
  .brand b{font-size:18px}
  .brand span{color:var(--dim);font-size:13px;margin-left:2px}
  .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:26px}
  h1{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:8px}
  .sub{color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px}
  .sub b{color:var(--text)}
  label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin:18px 0 7px}
  .opt{font-weight:400;color:var(--dim)}
  #drop{border:1.5px dashed var(--line2);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;background:#fbfbfe}
  #drop:hover,#drop.over{border-color:var(--acc);background:var(--accSoft)}
  #drop .ic{font-size:26px}
  #drop .t b{display:block;font-size:14px}
  #drop .t span{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim)}
  #drop .ok{margin-left:auto;color:var(--ok);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}
  .modes,.styles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
  .mode,.style{border:1.5px solid var(--line2);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;background:#fbfbfe}
  .mode:hover,.style:hover{border-color:var(--acc2)}
  .mode.sel,.style.sel{border-color:var(--acc);background:var(--accSoft)}
  .mode b,.style b{display:block;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:3px}
  .mode span,.style span{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.5}
  .startRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:24px}
  .startRow .hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim)}
  #prepSteps{margin-top:22px;display:none}
  .step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:9px 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--dim)}
  .step .dot{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--line2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;flex:none;transition:.2s}
  .step.doing .dot{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc);animation:pulse 1s infinite}
  .step.done{color:var(--text)}
  .step.done .dot{border-color:var(--ok);background:var(--ok);color:#fff}
  @keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.35}}
  #prepErr{margin-top:14px;color:var(--err);font-size:13px}

  /* ---------- Room ---------- */
  #view-room.active{display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100vh}
  .topbar{background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex:none}
  .topbar .logo{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),#9a8bff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px}
  .topbar .pos{font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
  .topbar .tag{font-size:11px;color:var(--acc);background:var(--accSoft);padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px;font-weight:600}
  .topbar .timer{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--dim);font-size:13px;margin-left:6px}
  .topbar .sp{flex:1}
  .roomGrid{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:250px 1fr 300px;gap:14px;padding:14px 20px;min-height:0;max-width:1400px;width:100%;margin:0 auto}
  .col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-height:0}
  .panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  /* 面试官卡 */
  .ivCard{padding:20px;text-align:center}
  .avatar{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--acc),#9a8bff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:32px;position:relative}
  .avatar::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-5px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid transparent}
  .avatar.speaking::after{border-color:var(--acc);animation:pulse 1s infinite}
  .ivName{font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
  .ivRole{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:14px}
  .statePill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:99px;background:#f1f2f8;color:var(--dim)}
  .statePill .sd{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#c2c5d4}
  .statePill.listening{background:var(--okSoft);color:var(--ok)} .statePill.listening .sd{background:var(--ok)}
  .statePill.thinking{background:#fdf4e3;color:var(--warn)} .statePill.thinking .sd{background:var(--warn);animation:pulse 1s infinite}
  .statePill.speaking{background:var(--accSoft);color:var(--acc)} .statePill.speaking .sd{background:var(--acc);animation:pulse .8s infinite}
  .vu{display:flex;gap:3px;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-end;height:26px;margin-top:16px}
  .vu i{width:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--acc2);height:4px;transition:height .1s}
  .ivTip{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:12px}
  /* 转写 */
  .trPanel{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0}
  .trHead{padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
  .trHead span{font-weight:400;color:var(--dim);font-size:12px}
  #transcript{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
  .msg{max-width:82%;padding:11px 15px;border-radius:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;white-space:pre-wrap}
  .msg .who{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:3px;font-weight:600}
  .msg.ai{align-self:flex-start;background:#f4f3ff;border:1px solid #e3dfff;border-bottom-left-radius:4px}
  .msg.user{align-self:flex-end;background:var(--okSoft);border:1px solid #cdeeda;border-bottom-right-radius:4px}
  .msg.sys{align-self:center;background:transparent;color:var(--dim);font-size:12px;padding:2px}
  /* 档案 */
  .profHead{padding:16px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .profHead .row1{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .profHead .pav{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffb56b,#ff8a5c);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px}
  .profHead b{font-size:14px;display:block}
  .profHead span{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim)}
  .badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:11px}
  .badge{font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px;background:#f1f2f8;color:var(--dim);font-weight:600}
  .badge.acc{background:var(--accSoft);color:var(--acc)}
  .profBody{padding:14px 18px;overflow-y:auto;flex:1}
  .sec{margin-bottom:16px}
  .sec .st{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px}
  .sec p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text)}
  .sec ul{list-style:none}
  .sec li{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;padding:6px 0 6px 18px;position:relative;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
  .sec li:last-child{border:none}
  .sec li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:13px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--acc2)}
  .locked{position:relative;filter:blur(5px);pointer-events:none;user-select:none}
  .lockWrap{position:relative}
  .lockBtn{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:2}
  .lockBtn button{background:rgba(28,30,42,.75);color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:8px 16px;backdrop-filter:blur(2px)}
  /* 底部输入 */
  .inputBar{flex:none;padding:0 20px 14px;max-width:1400px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:10px}
  .inputBar input{flex:1}
  .ctrlBtns{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
  .mic{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line2);background:var(--panel);font-size:17px}
  .mic.off{background:var(--errSoft);border-color:#f3c1c3}

  /* ---------- Report ---------- */
  #view-report.active{display:block;padding:36px 16px 60px}
  .repWrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}
  .repHead{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:28px;display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .ring{width:120px;height:120px;position:relative;flex:none}
  .ring svg{transform:rotate(-90deg)}
  .ring .num{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .ring .num b{font-size:30px}
  .ring .num span{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim)}
  .dims{flex:1;min-width:260px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px 24px}
  .dim .dl{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:5px}
  .dim .dl b{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .dim .bar{height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:#ededf5;overflow:hidden}
  .dim .bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--acc),#9a8bff);width:0;transition:width 1s ease}
  .repCard{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:28px;margin-bottom:16px}
  #repBody h1{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:12px}
  #repBody h2{font-size:15.5px;margin:20px 0 9px;color:var(--acc)}
  #repBody ul{padding-left:20px}
  #repBody li{margin:7px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75}
  #repBody p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;margin:9px 0}
  #repBody blockquote{border-left:3px solid var(--acc2);padding:6px 14px;background:var(--accSoft);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;margin:10px 0;font-size:13.5px}
  .repBtns{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .trRev{max-height:420px;overflow-y:auto}
  .toast{position:fixed;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#262936;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 20px;font-size:13px;z-index:99;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  /* ---------- 倒计时 / 设置 / 滚动提示 ---------- */
  .topbar .count{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px;background:#f1f2f8}
  .topbar .count.warn{background:var(--errSoft);color:var(--err);font-weight:700}
  .setWrap{position:relative}
  #setPop{position:absolute;right:0;top:46px;width:262px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:14px 16px;z-index:60;display:none}
  #setPop.on{display:block}
  #setPop label{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px}
  #setPop select{width:100%;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--line2);background:#fbfbfe;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--text);outline:none}
  #setPop input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--acc);margin-top:2px}
  #volVal{float:right;color:var(--dim);font-weight:400}
  .trPanel{position:relative}
  #jumpBottom{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:14px;transform:translateX(-50%);display:none;background:#262936;color:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 16px;font-size:12px;z-index:5;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  #jumpBottom.on{display:block}
  #profFold{display:none;margin-left:auto;background:none;color:var(--acc);font-size:12px;padding:4px 6px}

  /* ---------- 报告等待 / 骨架 ---------- */
  #repWait{display:none;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 14px 4px}
  #repWait.on{display:flex}
  #repWait .spin{width:16px;height:16px;border:2px solid var(--accSoft);border-top-color:var(--acc);border-radius:50%;animation:spin .8s linear infinite;flex:none}
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
  .skel{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eeeef6 25%,#f7f7fc 37%,#eeeef6 63%);background-size:400% 100%;animation:shimmer 1.4s infinite;border-radius:8px}
  @keyframes shimmer{0%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0 50%}}
  .skel.line{height:13px;margin:11px 0}
  .skel.h{height:20px;width:38%;margin:24px 0 14px}
  #repRetry{display:none;margin-top:6px}
  #ringTag{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:4px}

  /* ---------- 面试后答疑 ---------- */
  #askCard .sub{font-size:12.5px}
  .askBox{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end;margin-top:14px}
  .askBox textarea{flex:1;min-height:54px;resize:vertical}
  .askBox button{flex:none;padding:12px 22px}
  .askItem{border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding:14px 0}
  .askItem:first-child{border-top:none;padding-top:2px}
  .askQ{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.7}
  .askQ::before{content:"你";color:var(--acc);background:var(--accSoft);font-size:11px;border-radius:6px;padding:1px 6px;flex:none;line-height:16px;margin-top:2px}
  .askA{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.85}
  .askA h1,.askA h2,.askA h3{font-size:14px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--acc)}
  .askA ul,.askA ol{padding-left:20px;margin:6px 0}
  .askA li{margin:4px 0}
  .askA pre{background:#f6f6fb;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;overflow:auto;font-size:12.5px;margin:8px 0}
  .askA code{font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12.5px}
  .askA p{margin:7px 0}

  /* ---------- 训练记录 ---------- */
  #history{display:none;margin-top:16px}
  #history.on{display:block}
  .histCard{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:18px 22px}
  .histHead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px}
  .histHead span{font-weight:400;color:var(--dim);font-size:12px}
  .histRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim);border-top:1px dashed var(--line)}
  .histRow:first-of-type{border-top:none}
  .histRow b{color:var(--text);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:26px;text-align:right}
  .histRow .delta{margin-left:auto;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .histRow .delta.up{color:var(--ok)}
  .histRow .delta.down{color:var(--err)}
  .histBar{width:90px;height:6px;background:#ededf5;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;flex:none}
  .histBar i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--acc),#9a8bff);border-radius:99px}

  @media(max-width:1020px){
    #view-room.active{height:100dvh}
    .roomGrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:auto minmax(300px,1fr) auto;overflow-y:auto;padding:10px 12px;gap:10px}
    .topbar{padding:8px 12px;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .topbar .pos{font-size:13.5px}
    .trPanel{min-height:340px}
    #transcript{min-height:260px;padding:14px}
    .dims{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .ivCard{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr auto;grid-template-areas:"av name state" "av role vu" "tip tip tip";column-gap:12px;row-gap:4px;text-align:left;padding:12px 14px}
    .ivCard .avatar{grid-area:av;width:44px;height:44px;font-size:20px;margin:0}
    .ivCard .ivName{grid-area:name}
    .ivCard .ivRole{grid-area:role;margin:0;font-size:11.5px}
    .ivCard .statePill{grid-area:state;align-self:center;font-size:11px;padding:5px 10px}
    .ivCard .vu{grid-area:vu;margin:0;justify-content:flex-start;height:20px}
    .ivCard .vu i{width:3px}
    .ivCard .ivTip{grid-area:tip;margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;font-size:11px}
    .profHead{cursor:pointer}
    #profFold{display:inline-block}
    .col.profFolded .profBody{display:none}
    .profBody{max-height:44vh}
    .inputBar{padding:0 12px 10px}
  }
  @media(max-width:720px){
    #view-setup.active{padding:20px 10px}
    .card{padding:18px}
    h1{font-size:22px}
    .sub{margin-bottom:18px}
    .modes,.styles{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .startRow{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:10px}
    .startRow .hint{text-align:center}
    .topbar{gap:6px;padding:6px 10px}
    .topbar .logo{display:none}
    .topbar .tag,.topbar .timer{display:none}
    .topbar .pos{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;margin-right:2px}
    .topbar .count{font-size:11px;padding:3px 8px;flex:none}
    .topbar .mic{width:36px;height:36px;font-size:15px}
    .topbar .danger{padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;flex:none}
    .ivCard .ivTip{display:none}
    .msg{max-width:94%;font-size:13.5px}
    .repHead{padding:22px 18px;gap:16px;justify-content:center;text-align:center}
    .ring{margin:0 auto}
    .dims{width:100%;min-width:0}
    .repCard{padding:20px}
    .histBar{width:64px}
    .askBox{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
    .askBox button{width:100%}
    #view-report.active{padding:18px 10px 40px}
    #setPop{position:fixed;left:12px;right:12px;top:auto;bottom:12px;width:auto}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ 准备页 ============ -->
<div class="view active" id="view-setup">
  <div class="setup-wrap">
    <div class="brand"><div class="logo">🎙️</div><b>AI 模拟面试</b><span>resume × GitHub deep-dive</span></div>
    <div class="card">
      <h1>开始一场模拟面试</h1>
      <div class="sub">AI 面试官会<b>先做功课</b>（读简历 + 你的 GitHub 仓库），然后像真人一样语音追问——含糊必追，答不上来才放过。<b>真实面试</b>只聊业务与取舍，<b>代码深挖</b>会追到实现细节。<b>建议戴耳机</b>。</div>

      <label>简历 <span class="opt">（PDF / TXT / MD，可选但强烈建议）</span></label>
      <div id="drop">
        <div class="ic">📄</div>
        <div class="t"><b>点击或拖入简历文件</b><span>解析在本机服务完成，不留存</span></div>
        <div class="ok hidden" id="dropOk">✓ 已选择</div>
      </div>
      <input type="file" id="resumeFile" accept=".pdf,.txt,.md" class="hidden">

      <label>GitHub 仓库 <span class="opt">（可选，填了面试官会先读你的代码）</span></label>
      <input type="text" id="ghUrl" placeholder="owner/repo 或完整链接，如 https://github.com/you/your-repo">

      <label>目标岗位</label>
